    <ul class="plain-list radio-facts">
        <li><strong>Station name</strong>: <code>Icy-Name: Out of Bounds Entertainment</code></li>
        <li><strong>Tagline</strong>: <code>Icy-Description: Your Gaming Radio Station.</code></li>
        <li><strong>Station link</strong>: <code>Icy-Url: https://www.outofbounds.live</code></li>
        <li><strong>Format</strong>: MP3 over HTTP, served from <code>radio.outofbounds.live/listen/out_of_bounds/radio.mp3</code></li>
        <li><strong>Public endpoints</strong>: the stream sends CORS headers for this site, which is what lets the browser read those headers at all</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="meta-info">Stream URL to paste into any player: <code>https://radio.outofbounds.live/listen/out_of_bounds/radio.mp3</code></p>
